"P3047346067" "Atlas Park briefing"
// DetailString :
"P3588324418" "Atlas Park is probably the finest place in the city.  Clean and beautiful, hustling and bustling, Atlas Park was the first place to be restored after the Rikti War.  Of course, the Hellions do cause some problems here and there.  They started out as just a street gang, but some of them seem to have acquired pretty unusual abilities.  The police can't do much about superpowered thugs; it's up to you Heroes to help out."

